---
/**
 * Manifesto: the brand mission as a centered editorial moment.
 */
---

<section class="manifesto section-cream" aria-label="Manifesto">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="manifesto-headline">
      Keeping <span class="manifesto-em">humans</span> at the center of AI adoption.
    </p>
    <p class="manifesto-body">
      AI handles the noise. We handle what matters. The more we automate
      the repetitive, the more space we create for collaboration,
      creativity, and the kind of care that only humans bring.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    padding-block: var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .manifesto-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 1.5rem + 3.5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 0;
    line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .manifesto-em {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-cobalt);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .manifesto-body {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
</style>
